  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Headers stay; an interior cell lights with the header color exactly when\n ;; its ROW header equals its COLUMN header, else clears.\n (grid-from-fn h w (lambda (r c)\n   (if (or (= r 0) (= c 0)) (at g r c)\n       (if (= (at g 0 c) (at g r 0)) (at g 0 c) 0)))))",
